72511", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043854178", "personaname": "Red Solo Cup", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043854178/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 4076, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2181, "last_played": 1662867228, "avatar": "f190bb1aa3cdf3a5ac81dfd5c40a5c4854df04cc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, especially considering its free", "timestamp_created": 1362262521, "timestamp_updated": 1362262521, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2571599", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009425812", "personaname": "SmokinBudzShootnGunz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198009425812/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 2514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2450, "last_played": 1481081901, "avatar": "6a1bb05822eb5654a5faaa607abdcc2e6ec4fe73"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alien Swarm is a very unique game genera, incorporating multiple facets of gameplay, and splicing them together flawlessly. The primary factor which drew my attention was that the game was being offered on Steam, for FREE!!!! Most every veteran gamer can appreciate a game, which can ultimately keep the entertainment level consistant, and not have to pay a single penny to reap the enjoyment. Alien Swarm has achieved this by combining aspects of a third person scroller, and a fast paced, action packed shooter into one game platform. There is a game campaign, offering a chance to play with up to four total classes, and a character selection to choose from, selecting the best option to accomodate the squads needs. There are multiple weapon unlocks for each level up achieved, keeping the initial gameplay fresh, by throwing out multiple options to kill the deadly swarms as you progress through the campaign. When your character is maxed, the player can opt to prestige, gaining a class rank, and restarting the unlock process all over again. Once the campaign is completed, there is still a loyal fan base, which has developed a solid modding community. This arguably has erased any deficites which I had intially about Alien Swarm, and has brought me back to the game on multiple occasions with the release of new mods from the community. If you havent already downloaded this game from steam, you are truly missing out.", "timestamp_created": 1362256384, "timestamp_updated": 1362256384, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7046255", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083934177", "personaname": "Kirill", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KirillMe/", "num_games_owned": 225, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 2376, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1393, "last_played": 1441982312, "avatar": "68501d4f1f64d00b9d2c60f594ed009b2b10d7c8"}, "language": "english", "review": "\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1362250322, "timestamp_updated": 1362250322, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}